/-!
# A252001

Lexicographically earliest permutation of the positive integers, such that a carry occurs when adjacent terms are added in decimal representation.

The 67 terms known to OEIS, indexed from `1`.

Skeleton generated by `lake exe oeis-gen`; every declaration is a `sorry` placeholder.
-/

namespace A252001

/-- Known terms of `A252001`, starting at index `1`. -/
def data : List retType :=
  [1, 9, 2, 8, 3, 7, 4, 6, 5, 15,
    16, 14, 17, 13, 18, 12, 19, 11, 29, 21,
    39, 22, 28, 23, 27, 24, 26, 25, 35, 36,
